CloudBurrow patch 37 to github.com/goccy/bigquery-emulator v0.8.1
(cloudburrow/cloudburrow#1456). Needs googlesqlite patch 0047.

The bug: a request had no way to give the engine a default time zone, so
BigQuery's project option default_time_zone reached no query. The patch
reads the header X-Cloudburrow-Default-Time-Zone, which CloudBurrow's front
sends with a query of a project that sets the option (a tz database name
or an offset, "+05:30"), and runs the request's queries with
googlesqlite.WithDefaultTimeZone. A request without it is unchanged.

